{"candidate_id": "gyeongju-GJ01-0127", "title_ko": "석굴암", "ja": {"status": "OFFICIAL_TITLE_ONLY", "title": "石窟庵と仏国寺", "description": "慶尚北道慶州市にある。創建は8世紀半ばで、仏国寺の現在の建物は再建されたもの。伽藍配置は仏教浄土を表すとされ、境内には国宝の白雲橋、青雲橋、多宝塔、釈迦塔などの石造物が多くある。吐含山の山上の石窟庵は、石窟の円形空間に阿弥陀如来坐像を主仏として配している。", "desc_len": 128, "source_type": "UNESCO_OFFICIAL_NATIVE", "source_url": "https://whc.unesco.org/ja/list/736/", "entity_note": "UNESCO entry covers Seokguram Grotto AND Bulguksa Temple together (list 736). JA title includes both sites (石窟庵と仏国寺). JA description primarily covers Bulguksa with one sentence specific to 石窟庵 (Seokguram). OFFICIAL_TITLE_ONLY: entity mentioned in title + brief JA description sentence, but description is primarily for Bulguksa complex. Attribution: source NFUAJ. KTO JpnService2 HTTP403; bulguksa.or.kr KO only."}, "zh": {"status": "OFFICIAL_NATIVE_COMPLETE", "title": "石窟庵和佛国寺", "description": "石窟庵建于公元8世纪，位于吐含山的斜坡上，石窟庵内有一尊纪念佛像，该佛像以普密斯帕莎穆德拉姿势面朝着大海。佛像周围有各种神仙、菩萨和信徒的雕像，这些雕像惟妙惟肖，工艺细腻，采用了深浅浮雕的方式，堪称远东地区佛教艺术杰作。佛国寺（建于公元774年）和石窟庵一起构成了一处具有重大意义的宗教建筑群。", "desc_len": 147, "locale": "zh-CN", "source_type": "UNESCO_OFFICIAL_NATIVE", "source_url": "https://whc.unesco.org/zh/list/736/", "entity_note": "UNESCO entry covers Seokguram Grotto AND Bulguksa Temple (list 736). ZH title 石窟庵和佛国寺. ZH description (147 chars) primarily describes Seokguram then notes Bulguksa. KTO ChsService2 HTTP403; bulguksa.or.kr KO only."}, "as_of": "2026-09-12"}
